  "title": "Grandma&#39;s French Dressing",
  "description": "This quick and flavorful French dressing is the white variety, which is made without ketchup. Boasting a variety of spices (including tarragon, paprika, thyme, and garlic) and with a white wine undertone, this dressing is a versatile topping for almost any green salad.",
